+     * <li>Offset time pattern (e.g. "+HH:mm" - see {@link #getGMTOffsetPattern})
+     * <li>Offset digits (e.g. "0123456789" - see {@link #getGMTOffsetDigits})
+     * <li>GMT zero format (e.g. "GMT" - see {@link #getGMTZeroFormat})
